# Ignore generated log files upon CUDA compilation
*.tlog
*.user
*_imgui.ini
mode/android/*
mode/linux/*
mode/mac/*
mode/platform010/*
mode/win/*
mode/dbg*
mode/dev*
mode/opt
mode/cuda/dbg*
mode/cuda/dev*
mode/cuda/opt
build*
# ...but not the checked-in wheel build driver, which `build*` matches by accident.
!tools/build_wheels.py
# ...nor a prefab's own `src/build.py`, the generator that rebuilds its CAD. `build*` matched
# those by accident too, so `sl add` silently skipped every new prefab's builder and several
# shipped with no way to rebuild them.
!assets/prefabs/**/src/build.py
ref
*.local.cmake
cmake-build*
.idea
.polyscope.ini
CMakeUserPresets.json
imgui.ini
SuperDexStudio.ini
*.recording.h5
*.state.h5
audit_reports/
default.profraw
*.egg-info/
